  "Id": 1308,
  "Title": "Workshop on intended learning outcomes (ILOs) at SONAM, Kenya",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "The Teaching and Learning Network conducted ILOs workshop to 10 SONAM-Kenya faculty.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass3408AB85DD8F4A8D9B31E7BB7499D221\"><p>The Teaching and Learning Network conducted ILOs workshop to 10 SONAM-Kenya&#160;faculty. The workshop aimed at&#160;enabling&#160;the participants develop ILOs that lead to students' significant learning or students adopting deep learning approaches. By the end of the session, faculty&#160;refined their course learning outcomes in relation to Bloom's Taxonomy,&#160;Fink's Significant learning, Moon's Learning Environment and Bigg's Structure of Observed Learning Outcomes-SOLO.</p></div>",
